{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0563_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0563_1000_p", "source_sha256": "9529fe6a515286d2eeb91486d12349fd6e158c984e71fff8e0bd47ba25bc6625", "ja": "（可奈が動物番組のゲストに呼んでもらえた。\n何度目かの出演で、すっかり準レギュラー扱いだ）", "zh": "（可奈受邀担任动物节目的嘉宾。因为已经参加过好几次，俨然成了半固定嘉宾。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0563_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0563_1001_p", "source_sha256": "df43283a03adaba09d6c253402c5d361ab9673e5dff67bbbb9114c8bd44569d2", "ja": "それじゃ今日はここで。\nごめんな、収録に付き添えなくて。", "zh": "那今天就到这里。\n抱歉，没法陪你来录制。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0563_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0563_1002_036kan", "source_sha256": "78e06fa8cdc5db925dc3a5bdef5a295ddd18bb3f6421eb0293e7e9b45a03dd1a", "ja": "大丈夫です！　もう何度も出てる番組だし。", "zh": "没关系的！反正是已经上过好多次的节目了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0563_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0563_1003_036kan", "source_sha256": "9a8abff26b429787ebc88ac46acbac1621d0de20b80868f1734799c24dd98e81", "ja": "{$P$}さんこそ、忙しいのに\n送ってくれて、ありがとうございました！", "zh": "{$P$}先生才是一直那么忙，\n还特地送我过来，真是太谢谢您了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0563_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0563_1004_p", "source_sha256": "8a7f85b0dd886e9759e47978dc7d22363d33ecdab8f58aa1f48a49ee9e911805", "ja": "（『Eternal Spiral』公演を経て、\n可奈も心なしか大人びた気がする）", "zh": "（经历了《Eternal Spiral》公演后，感觉可奈也不知不觉变得成熟了些）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0563_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0563_1005_p", "source_sha256": "2c7f4dd784518fc01dec8007a2a102d480b0c3b7b88f4d9a5719ac62ba025c79", "ja": "（そうだよな。地方での仕事だって、\nもう14歳同士だけでこなせるんだ……、うん？）", "zh": "（是啊。连地方上的工作，也已经能由14岁的人自己完成了……嗯？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0563_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0563_1006_p", "source_sha256": "a15f941268fabfd4760858d41b8ddaea2a25598bca31e8b969724c80f40d6957", "ja": "そこに置いてある紙袋って、なんだっけ。\n今日、要る物ってあったかな？", "zh": "放在那边的纸袋，是做什么来着？\n今天有需要用到的东西吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0563_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0563_1007_036kan", "source_sha256": "37e9c85eb67b9bde85bd96340ba5d1b680050a994fd6b853abec204f45c77b46", "ja": "あ！　これはですね～。\nえへへ、差し入れです！", "zh": "啊！这个嘛～  \n嘿嘿，是慰问品！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0563_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0563_1008_036kan", "source_sha256": "8bbbc6c9cd56de4da4b920aa7d14971968edc2a7ff7a9da243a9612d570059e9", "ja": "いつもお世話になってる共演者さんに。\nこういうの、大人なら大事だなぁって思って。", "zh": "是给一直关照我的共演者们的。\n我觉得作为大人，这种礼节可是很重要的哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0563_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0563_1009_036kan", "source_sha256": "5e1eabdd93625dc5cfec9a77fd472e4e01809c6e67f6e3ca1103dda0be44bb9e", "ja": "最近人気のシュークリームなんですよ♪\n朝、寄り道して買ってきちゃいました！", "zh": "这是最近很受欢迎的泡芙哦♪\n早上特意绕路去买来的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0563_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0563_1010_p", "source_sha256": "78b542c1b9ad0352f8a80e73d79c38fefcf840a3947160ed74d93bc5c7874477", "ja": "そんなことまで……。\nおこづかいは大丈夫なのか？", "zh": "连这种事都……零花钱没问题吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0563_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0563_1011_036kan", "source_sha256": "849bd2e8aaa7a5e9b0244a00eed928329f14cf7f60ccc77d2167c9ec53d26579", "ja": "大丈夫です！　ちょっと小さいぶん安いので。\nでも美味しいから、みんなに食べてほしくって♪", "zh": "没问题的！虽然个头小了点，但也比较便宜。\n不过味道很好，所以很想让大家也尝尝♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0563_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0563_1012_p", "source_sha256": "432181fd7cad0fb8151426d4ae916ed22e4f7dcffee8833aae44cc5a5b572aa8", "ja": "そうか……。やよいと二人だけでの仕事は、\n本当に、いい経験になったんだな。", "zh": "这样啊……和弥生两个人一起工作的经历，真的让你收获很大啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0563_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0563_1013_036kan", "source_sha256": "3d5d526a343fcd29c0c28a883d48aff09231abb776ad6b94d128835db714ef35", "ja": "えへへっ♪　いきなり大人にはなれないけど、\n少しずつ近づくくらいなら、できるかな～って。", "zh": "嘿嘿♪ 虽然不可能一下子就变成大人，但要是一点一点地靠近，应该还是做得到的吧～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0563_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0563_1014_036kan", "source_sha256": "815cfb8fd095b5c56a176caf6962a4ce9e2d56a5266a9916391b0066b121024f", "ja": "可奈は大人じゃないさ～、だけど背伸びしたいんだ～♪", "zh": "可奈还不是大人呢～，可是好想快点长大呀～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0563_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0563_1015_p", "source_sha256": "42362101ea6763a705524de97234aed9a2c7c85d437c88e4df91434f999c7c3b", "ja": "あれ？　シールに要冷蔵って書いてあるけど……\n買ったのは何時間前だ？　保冷剤、そんなに持つのか？", "zh": "咦？贴纸上写着需要冷藏……\n是什么时候买的来着？保冷剂能撑那么久吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0563_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0563_1016_036kan", "source_sha256": "7924760bba0df9482b110950e87f23578e3fb9d6e0f2381352076918fc8a240b", "ja": "え……？　よう、れいぞう……？", "zh": "诶……？要、冷藏……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0563_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0563_1017_036kan", "source_sha256": "a6dd7f7fa25603a24985dc3e951d4a731391de1dae1d4c08f1c34da46b9ce881", "ja": "あああっ！？　ほんとだ～！！　いつも買って\nすぐ食べるから、気にしてなかった～！！", "zh": "啊啊啊！？真的耶～！！因为平时买了就马上吃，所以都没注意～！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0563_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0563_1018_036kan", "source_sha256": "72d2d80da609f04e5b005aea01be758ea78e1bb7a8a1a81dab855e908d206cc8", "ja": "えと、今はもうおやつ時だから、買ったのは……。\n4……5……6時間、前……デス。", "zh": "那个，现在已经是吃点心的时间了，所以买下来已经是……4……5……6小时前……了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0563_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0563_1019_036kan", "source_sha256": "9109f612e51420b8c1df54e6fe26885a3895be09f8001cb99ece15158bf41092", "ja": "{$P$}さん、これって、もう～……？", "zh": "{$P$}先生，这个是不是已经～……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0563_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0563_1020_p", "source_sha256": "aad702288e495437320f1de501068a86c6cbd2eb5975d838ade71d0f7c64204f", "ja": "うーん、食べられるとは思うけど、人に渡すのは……\n控えたほうがいいだろうな……。", "zh": "嗯……我觉得应该能吃，不过要拿给别人……还是算了吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0563_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0563_1021_036kan", "source_sha256": "30bfcf9f1178226d53df4713db9d8bda6b78874ededba1d69be6de884eaeaf26", "ja": "そんなぁ～！　せっかく買ってきたのに～！", "zh": "怎么会这样～！我可是好不容易买回来的～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0563_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0563_1022_p", "source_sha256": "80c15e8096cae3f46dc2218d38a13da79a2370aebd60332dea073b6ec82fedd7", "ja": "ま、また今度！　呼んでもらえるように頑張ろう！\n次は常温のお菓子を用意して、ただ今日は時間だから！", "zh": "下、下次再来！为了能再次被邀请，我们一起努力吧！  \n下次准备常温的点心，不过今天时间不早了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0563_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0563_1023_p", "source_sha256": "82ab808a8d06d1c24657655b5aa700233d1880585599d82e668ff80698a10853", "ja": "シュークリームは事務所で確認して、大丈夫そうなら\nお茶請けに引き取らせてもらうよ。わぁ美味しそう！", "zh": "泡芙我会在事务所确认一下，要是没问题的话，就拿来当茶点吧。哇，看起来真好吃！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0563_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0563_1024_036kan", "source_sha256": "452e9870189be3021014a51d3bfc96965992723e54f3dcd6068f530f0867d60b", "ja": "はぁ～い……。あ、時間！\nあの、とにかく行ってきますー！", "zh": "好～……啊，时间到了！\n那个，总之我先走了——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0563_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0563_1025_p", "source_sha256": "c57b32987a988fecd2378a67dcef64fffea70868a71e608b5291d5714a2e543c", "ja": "（……大人になるのは、焦らず一歩ずつでいい。\n可奈、これからもゆっくり、頑張って行こう！）", "zh": "（……长大这件事，不用着急，一步一步来就好。\n可奈，今后也一起慢慢努力吧！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
